	(681, 'christies', 4684281, 'https://www.christies.com/en/lot/lot-4684281?ldp_breadcrumb=back', 10, 6, '67', 'sold', 'A LARGE SILK PANEL, AZERBAJAN, POSSIBLY 17TH CENTURY', 'GBP 2,400', 'GBP 2,000 - GBP 4,000', 1, 'A LARGE SILK PANEL, AZERBAJAN, POSSIBLY 17TH CENTURY\nwoven with an eight pointed star lattice, with two remaining integral lateral guard stripes--\n76in (192cm.) x 50in.(126cm.)', 'Little is known about this group of silks other than a number seem to have been found in Azjerbajan in recent times. They range in date from 16th to 19th centuries.', 'ok', '2026-10-17 07:02:54', '2026-10-17 07:02:54', '2026-10-17 07:02:54'),
